{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42760","headline":"咸阳怀古 · 刘兼","name":"咸阳怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高秋咸镐起霜风，秦汉荒陵树叶红。\n七国鬬鸡方贾勇，中原逐鹿更争雄。\n南山漠漠云常在，渭水悠悠事旋空。\n立马举鞭遥望处，阿房遗址夕阳东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}